msgstr "Exakte Protokollebene: 0 Fatal, 1 Fehler, 2 Warnung, 3 Info, 4 Debug."

#: registry/filters/harvesting.py:136
msgid ""
"Lines of this level and worse; the levels count from fatal, so 2 answers "
